
---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Biz haqimizda"
  description="Foydali Blog loyihasi haqida."
>
  <section class="container" style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 64px;">
    <h1>Biz haqimizda</h1>
    <p>
      Foydali Blog — jamiyat uchun foydali bilimlar, sodda tushuntirishlar
      va kundalik hayotda qo‘llash mumkin bo‘lgan tavsiyalarni ulashish
      maqsadida yaratilgan loyiha.
    </p>

    <h2>Maqsadimiz</h2>
    <p>
      Odamlarga bilim olish, o‘z ustida ishlash va foydali odatlarni
      shakllantirishda yordam berish.
    </p>

    <h2>Qadriyatlarimiz</h2>
    <p>
      Ishonchli ma’lumot, tushunarli til, amaliy foyda va jamiyatga
      xizmat qilish.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
